WEBVTT

00:10.760 --> 00:13.810
They're huge! What are those birds?

00:16.370 --> 00:17.640
No way...

00:17.640 --> 00:19.120
Is that the dungeon?

01:51.520 --> 01:53.360
Those bird monsters are gryphons.

01:53.960 --> 01:57.710
Their nest is filled with gold 
that they've stolen from people.

01:58.260 --> 02:02.790
Due to their viciousness toward humans,
they're considered pests.

02:06.490 --> 02:08.180
That sounds bad.

02:07.480 --> 02:09.770
This is going to make for a good hunt.

02:11.250 --> 02:16.560
Your task for the exam will be to bring 
gold back from the dungeon by sundown.

02:16.560 --> 02:19.740
The time it takes you to bring it back 
will determine your grade.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.720
You want us to go in there?!

02:21.720 --> 02:23.070
Are you out of your mind?

02:23.070 --> 02:24.700
I'm aware of the dangers.

02:25.360 --> 02:29.070
Have you all put on the Bracelets 
of Hermes that you were given?

02:31.210 --> 02:35.390
Those bracelets are imbued 
with teleportation spells.

02:35.390 --> 02:37.900
You can escape from 
the dungeon at any time.

02:37.900 --> 02:40.040
Doing so will disqualify you,

02:40.040 --> 02:43.370
but it may activate automatically 
if your life is in danger.

02:43.770 --> 02:47.680
Gryphons are far more formidable than the 
golem you fought in the entrance exam.

02:47.680 --> 02:52.640
But magic has a way of shining 
brighter the greater the ordeal.

02:53.080 --> 02:55.850
Create a path for yourself 
with your own strength!

02:56.670 --> 02:58.440
This sounds fun.

02:58.440 --> 03:00.660
I'm up first!

03:00.940 --> 03:03.080
I was still talking.

03:03.400 --> 03:05.210
Let's go, Chiron.

03:05.800 --> 03:06.800
Are you scared?

03:06.800 --> 03:08.110
Wh-Wha?

03:08.110 --> 03:10.070
Th-This'll be a piece of cake.

03:10.070 --> 03:12.820
What a pain. I'll pass.

03:12.820 --> 03:14.270
Get it together, stupid.

03:19.010 --> 03:21.500
What's with this exam? This is so scary.

03:21.500 --> 03:24.580
No, I have to stop chickening out.

03:24.580 --> 03:30.630
I have to complete it faster than 
anyone and impress Professor Claude!

03:35.020 --> 03:35.920
Shoot!

03:35.920 --> 03:36.970
My wand!

03:38.700 --> 03:40.580
Scorpion Magic...

03:41.460 --> 03:43.360
Red Stinger: Poison Injection!

03:50.780 --> 03:52.720
Are you helping me?

03:52.720 --> 03:54.780
Huh? Were you here the whole time?

03:54.780 --> 03:56.690
You didn't even notice me?!

03:56.690 --> 03:59.440
I just drove it off 
because it was in my way.

04:00.110 --> 04:05.600
Also, if you're getting stuck already, 
you might as well forfeit.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.790
What?!

04:11.530 --> 04:14.730
So your coven has started, too, 
Professor Claude.

04:14.730 --> 04:16.130
Vice Principal.

04:16.130 --> 04:19.090
Yes, everyone's gotten started.

04:19.090 --> 04:20.990
That's fantastic.

04:21.520 --> 04:25.680
Some students in other covens 
forfeited from the start.

04:28.380 --> 04:30.880
It's been ten minutes 
since the exam began.

04:30.880 --> 04:34.960
18 out of 108 students forfeited 
before they got to the nest.

04:35.420 --> 04:38.630
The rest seem to have made it inside.

04:39.320 --> 04:41.920
We'll see how many pass.

04:42.580 --> 04:47.050
The question is whether or not they 
discover the true meaning of this dungeon.

04:48.260 --> 04:53.640
FIRST CHALLENGE: HATCHLING FEEDING GROUNDS

04:55.280 --> 04:58.310
How the hell are you 
supposed to get past this?!

04:59.180 --> 05:01.540
It's obvious.

05:02.520 --> 05:06.040
The same way you get through any problem.

05:06.670 --> 05:10.350
Leo Magic: Gorilla Princess!

05:10.870 --> 05:14.120
MY, WHAT POWER

05:19.140 --> 05:22.840
I have no interest in tormenting chicks.

05:22.840 --> 05:25.040
Stay put and get some sleep.

05:25.040 --> 05:28.790
Now, everyone, you're 
welcome to praise me!

05:29.180 --> 05:30.840
Huh? Guys?

05:31.160 --> 05:34.530
The people from Pandora's 
Box really are scary.

05:35.110 --> 05:37.820
This girl's amazing.

05:37.820 --> 05:40.730
She had no trouble making it 
through the first challenge.

05:40.730 --> 05:45.170
Claude Coven's students 
are in the lead so far.

05:45.170 --> 05:48.290
I thought they'd be hopeless with 
all the problem students they have.

05:48.290 --> 05:49.500
Impressive.

05:49.500 --> 05:50.710
Right?

05:50.710 --> 05:57.320
In the lead is either Regulus of Claude 
Coven or Persephone of Pegasus Coven.

05:57.740 --> 06:00.400
Aquarius is worth keeping an eye on,

06:00.400 --> 06:03.040
but who knows if their 
dark horse will catch up?

06:03.040 --> 06:07.270
It'll be interesting to see how they 
make it through the three challenges.

06:07.270 --> 06:09.250
If they make a good showing here,

06:09.250 --> 06:11.770
they can overcome their 
reputation as "Pandora's Box."

06:12.030 --> 06:13.830
Come on, everyone!

06:15.430 --> 06:16.890
Hang on...

06:16.890 --> 06:18.490
Where's Spica?

06:19.610 --> 06:21.480
Still outside.

06:21.480 --> 06:24.180
What the hell are they doing?! 
They're in last place!

06:26.550 --> 06:28.870
Absolutely unbelievable.

06:28.870 --> 06:30.770
This is such a loss.

06:30.770 --> 06:32.620
All because you're taking your sweet time!

06:32.620 --> 06:33.770
What?!

06:33.770 --> 06:38.400
The bridge collapsed because that 
poisoned gryphon crashed into it!

06:38.400 --> 06:40.330
Shut up and climb!

06:40.330 --> 06:42.120
Don't tell me what to do!

06:44.080 --> 06:46.740
I need to catch up quick.

06:48.790 --> 06:51.490
I've never been in a dungeon before!

06:51.490 --> 06:53.880
The floor's so soft!

06:54.770 --> 06:56.820
The mushrooms are glowing!

06:56.820 --> 06:57.940
Wow!

06:57.940 --> 06:58.940
Is it magic?

06:58.940 --> 07:00.710
How are they glowing?

07:00.710 --> 07:03.490
They look so tasty!

07:01.180 --> 07:03.490
Stop frolicking like a moron.

07:03.490 --> 07:06.030
You don't have a speck of urgency, do you?

07:06.030 --> 07:09.400
What's her problem, anyway?

07:10.540 --> 07:13.920
I'm a better student than Spica!

07:13.920 --> 07:17.560
Does she have feelings 
for Professor Claude?

07:17.560 --> 07:20.950
Maybe that's why she's so hostile to me. 
Because I'm with him all the time.

07:21.930 --> 07:23.420
You aren't getting ahead of me!

07:24.130 --> 07:26.330
Not in the exam, and not 
with Professor Claude!

07:26.580 --> 07:28.630
Huh? The professor?

07:43.920 --> 07:45.630
A gryphon hatchling!

07:45.630 --> 07:47.790
Looks like these are the 
hatchlings' feeding grounds.

07:47.790 --> 07:49.750
Does that mean we're the food?!

07:51.020 --> 07:54.240
All this squealing from every direction...

07:54.240 --> 07:56.050
I'm going ahead of you.

07:56.050 --> 07:58.090
You're free to stand here trembling.

07:58.090 --> 07:59.210
What?

07:59.210 --> 08:00.840
I can fight too, you know.

08:00.840 --> 08:02.280
How?

08:02.710 --> 08:06.750
Gryphon feathers are so thick that 
not even poison magic gets through.

08:07.320 --> 08:10.550
All your magic can do is grow weeds. 
What's it good for here?

08:12.060 --> 08:13.700
Don't underestimate me!

08:13.700 --> 08:16.610
I've been training the past three months!

08:16.610 --> 08:20.470
Virgo Magic: Anima Transform!

08:21.200 --> 08:23.180
Birdcage of the Trees!

08:24.790 --> 08:26.150
Huh.

08:26.150 --> 08:28.670
Yes! It worked!

08:28.670 --> 08:31.280
My technique works in exams!

08:31.280 --> 08:34.820
Was it part of your plan 
to trap me in here?

08:34.820 --> 08:36.060
Sorry.

08:36.060 --> 08:39.020
My control isn't quite perfect yet.

08:41.700 --> 08:42.900
Unbelievable.

08:42.900 --> 08:45.040
Could you not hold me back?

08:45.040 --> 08:45.970
You suck.

08:45.970 --> 08:50.340
I suck? I apologized already! 
Are you still mad?

08:50.340 --> 08:51.620
I'm not mad.

08:51.620 --> 08:53.260
I'm just disappointed.

09:00.300 --> 09:02.090
What is this place?

09:02.920 --> 09:06.300
The walls are made of 
rocks instead of straw.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.030
Perhaps they use different 
construction magic

09:09.030 --> 09:11.490
depending on what the rooms are meant for.

09:11.490 --> 09:12.770
Fascinating.

09:13.170 --> 09:15.340
Such an expansive colony...

09:15.340 --> 09:17.500
It's almost like a sociable weaver's nest.

09:17.500 --> 09:19.000
A social...?

09:19.000 --> 09:23.580
It's a species of bird that spends 
decades building massive nests in flocks.

09:23.890 --> 09:29.060
Their size also makes them homes for 
other animals, which they coexist with.

09:29.890 --> 09:33.210
There might be some other 
creatures here, too.

09:33.210 --> 09:35.690
Wow, you know a lot of stuff.

09:35.690 --> 09:38.170
Well, I do read a lot of books.

09:38.470 --> 09:39.740
Shoot.

09:39.740 --> 09:42.230
I don't have time to be giving lectures.

09:44.130 --> 09:45.970
I heard a voice from over there!

09:47.780 --> 09:50.190
We finally caught up 
with the rest of them!

09:51.140 --> 09:54.110
SECOND CHALLENGE: MONSTER COLONY

09:51.150 --> 09:54.110
The second challenge: a monster colony.

09:54.420 --> 09:57.820
There really are other creatures 
besides the gryphons!

09:59.880 --> 10:02.270
How do we deal with so many of them?

10:02.270 --> 10:04.490
Everyone else is stuck now, too.

10:05.230 --> 10:06.500
Not a problem.

10:08.210 --> 10:10.230
Wait, what are you doing?

10:13.430 --> 10:15.370
The monsters are avoiding her.

10:15.370 --> 10:20.950
No matter the species, creatures know 
instinctively to avoid poisonous things.

10:21.320 --> 10:26.180
Especially if it's one that's cowardly 
enough to cohabit with another species.

10:27.450 --> 10:30.590
She's pretty snotty,
 but she's kinda badass, too.

10:30.590 --> 10:34.940
Even if she knows she won't be attacked, 
how can she be so calm?

10:37.650 --> 10:39.090
She came back!

10:39.500 --> 10:42.340
Go ahead and defeat those things.

10:42.340 --> 10:43.370
What things?

10:44.290 --> 10:46.350
Bug monsters?

10:48.090 --> 10:51.230
What's wrong? Do you not like bugs?

10:52.790 --> 10:55.090
You have an adorable side, don't you?

10:55.090 --> 10:57.180
What? I'm not afraid of them.

10:57.180 --> 10:59.360
They just don't react to my poison.

10:59.360 --> 11:00.970
You don't need to act tough.

11:00.970 --> 11:05.600
Relax. I'll protect you.

11:07.380 --> 11:11.560
I told you, I'm not afraid!

11:13.600 --> 11:15.160
Poison Rain!

11:18.010 --> 11:19.720
See? Easy.

11:20.530 --> 11:21.910
M-My clothes!

11:21.910 --> 11:24.370
Seriously, watch it!

11:24.820 --> 11:26.590
Sorry...

11:28.790 --> 11:30.160
No kidding.

11:30.160 --> 11:32.210
We got poison on us, too.

11:32.210 --> 11:36.000
I'm a Scorpio, too, but I could 
never use such a dangerous spell.

11:36.520 --> 11:39.420
Hey, she's in Pandora's Box.

11:39.420 --> 11:40.690
No wonder.

11:40.690 --> 11:42.710
Let's keep our distance.

11:49.920 --> 11:53.900
H-Hey, don't let it get to you.

11:53.900 --> 11:58.590
It's actually kind of a big deal that you 
took down all those bugs in one shot.

11:58.590 --> 11:59.770
Shut up.

12:01.380 --> 12:03.650
Don't try to get friendly with me.

12:03.650 --> 12:06.690
You understand my abilities now.

12:08.190 --> 12:10.780
If you value your life,

12:11.980 --> 12:14.280
you should stay away from me.

12:16.530 --> 12:19.720
Good grief. What are they doing?

12:19.720 --> 12:22.330
I thought they were finally getting along.

12:25.130 --> 12:29.310
They need to get moving, 
or they're both going to fail.

12:33.720 --> 12:35.490
This is a problem.

12:35.490 --> 12:38.110
I made it all the way here first...

12:38.490 --> 12:42.410
But I don't think I can get through this.

12:45.170 --> 12:48.920
The students choose one 
of the many entrances,

12:48.920 --> 12:54.970
work their way through three challenges, 
and arrive at the goal: the gold room.

12:55.460 --> 13:01.340
FINAL CHALLENGE: GRYPHONS' SLEEPING AREA

12:56.070 --> 12:57.580
Come on...

12:57.580 --> 13:00.110
Am I supposed to get 
through this huge flock?

13:00.110 --> 13:01.580
This is brutal.

13:02.200 --> 13:05.310
But Ewe and I made it here together.

13:05.310 --> 13:07.090
Let's do this, Ewe!

13:07.430 --> 13:12.320
Ah, it's nice and warm in its mouth.

13:13.640 --> 13:16.190
I'm tired. Gonna take a nap.

13:16.640 --> 13:18.610
Goodnight.

13:18.610 --> 13:21.150
Bracelet of Hermes activated.

13:22.450 --> 13:25.070
Ewe Aries is disqualified.

13:28.450 --> 13:30.700
That moron!

13:32.660 --> 13:34.500
Are you okay? You aren't hurt, are you?

13:34.500 --> 13:35.910
Nothing got on your clothes?

13:35.910 --> 13:36.760
Yeah.

13:36.760 --> 13:38.180
It's too dangerous ahead.

13:38.180 --> 13:39.930
I'll go grab the gold real quick.

13:39.930 --> 13:41.250
Wait here.

13:41.250 --> 13:42.300
No, I'll...

13:42.300 --> 13:44.230
Here, put on some armor!

13:44.230 --> 13:48.360
And your canteen and insect 
repellent and snacks...

13:48.360 --> 13:51.780
And if anything happens to me, 
get someone to help you, okay?

13:51.780 --> 13:54.000
Don't go anywhere dangerous by yourself.

13:54.710 --> 13:56.610
Shut it! You're not my mom!

13:56.900 --> 13:58.630
This is an exam!

13:58.630 --> 14:00.590
I'm getting through it on my own!

14:00.590 --> 14:01.950
Don't try to help me!

14:01.950 --> 14:02.680
But...

14:03.010 --> 14:04.500
Watch me.

14:04.500 --> 14:07.330
Watch my ultra magic super—

14:10.070 --> 14:11.710
Chiron is disqualified.

14:11.710 --> 14:13.780
Chiron!

14:13.780 --> 14:16.070
I'm right behind you!

14:17.300 --> 14:19.500
Tarf is disqualified.

14:21.010 --> 14:23.970
Claude Coven's all kinds of messed up.

14:25.170 --> 14:28.530
Come on, everyone. Buck up.

14:28.530 --> 14:31.920
You don't even know how difficult 
the final challenge is yet!

14:36.260 --> 14:38.210
There are too many!

14:41.810 --> 14:43.680
Scorpion Magic...

14:44.950 --> 14:46.690
Octuple Scorpion!

14:47.290 --> 14:49.090
Be careful.

14:49.090 --> 14:53.410
These poison tentacles detect and 
ensnare anything in their proximity.

14:53.410 --> 14:55.850
Gah, what is that freaky magic? Yeesh.

14:55.850 --> 14:58.410
I think it'll get us if we get too close.

14:58.410 --> 14:59.920
You're right.

15:00.680 --> 15:05.050
If you two don't want to become its prey, 
you'd best stand there terrified.

15:05.050 --> 15:06.880
She heard us?!

15:07.280 --> 15:10.890
This magic protects me from every angle.

15:10.890 --> 15:13.600
The downside is that it 
consumes a lot of magic power.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.440
But that's not an issue.

15:16.840 --> 15:21.810
There are so many gryphons here.
That must mean the gold is nearby.

15:25.240 --> 15:27.260
The gryphons are pulling back.

15:27.650 --> 15:29.050
I made it past the pack!

15:48.260 --> 15:51.350
I'll take first place.

15:51.890 --> 15:53.690
Without anyone's help.

16:01.630 --> 16:02.720
It's shining!

16:02.720 --> 16:04.970
The gold must be in there!

16:10.020 --> 16:12.590
Wh-What is this thing?

16:12.590 --> 16:15.160
Two heads and four wings...

16:15.160 --> 16:17.090
And it's bigger than the others!

16:17.090 --> 16:18.720
Is it a mutant gryphon?

16:22.100 --> 16:23.200
But...

16:23.610 --> 16:25.970
I have Octuple Scorpion!

16:25.970 --> 16:27.660
You'll be letting me through!

16:36.840 --> 16:38.640
M-Magic?!

16:45.200 --> 16:47.970
It broke through my Octuple Scorpion.

16:49.980 --> 16:53.380
I don't have any more ways to protect 
myself from the electric shocks.

16:57.770 --> 17:00.000
Can I really defeat it on my own?

17:01.480 --> 17:02.900
No...

17:02.900 --> 17:05.450
I have to do it, even if I'm on my own.

17:05.450 --> 17:09.070
Or I'm going to get someone hurt again.

17:09.790 --> 17:12.510
It hurts! It hurts!

17:12.510 --> 17:13.860
She has poison in her arm!

17:13.230 --> 17:15.040
It'll happen again.

17:13.860 --> 17:15.040
Somebody, call a doctor!

17:16.560 --> 17:19.630
I'm sorry. It's because I touched her.

17:19.630 --> 17:21.840
Get away, you freak!

17:24.480 --> 17:27.750
I don't want to hurt anyone anymore.

17:27.750 --> 17:29.510
And I don't want to get hurt.

17:32.220 --> 17:33.440
Which is why...

17:34.730 --> 17:38.610
I'm going to defeat it 
without anyone's help!

17:39.450 --> 17:41.310
I don't have much magic left.

17:41.310 --> 17:44.040
I'll hit it with my most powerful magic!

17:47.340 --> 17:51.010
Scorpion Magic: Emperor Scorpion!

18:11.200 --> 18:13.670
Even with my most powerful magic...

18:16.410 --> 18:18.450
I lost.

18:24.580 --> 18:25.850
Damn it.

18:28.650 --> 18:29.450
Anima!

18:35.750 --> 18:37.300
This magic...

18:37.870 --> 18:41.130
Finally... There you are.

18:41.130 --> 18:42.810
Why are you...

18:43.590 --> 18:45.350
Why did you help me?

18:45.350 --> 18:47.880
I told you to stay away from me.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.510
Leave me alone!

18:50.000 --> 18:51.240
What a pain.

18:52.610 --> 18:55.030
You're so stubborn.

18:55.030 --> 18:57.150
Can't you at least say "thank you"?

18:57.150 --> 18:59.040
I never asked for your help.

18:59.040 --> 19:01.410
I'm going to get through this by myself.

19:01.410 --> 19:06.330
You say that, but you looked kinda 
happy when you were with me.

19:06.330 --> 19:09.210
I bet, deep down, you want some friends.

19:09.210 --> 19:11.920
Wh-What?!

19:12.140 --> 19:14.450
Wh-Wh-What makes you think that?!

19:14.450 --> 19:16.650
Now isn't the time to bicker.

19:16.650 --> 19:19.030
Put that all aside and help me.

19:22.260 --> 19:26.000
Help you? Do you intend
to fight alongside me?

19:26.000 --> 19:29.020
There's no way I can beat 
that thing by myself.

19:29.020 --> 19:30.910
Have you forgotten what just happened?

19:30.910 --> 19:33.050
I might get you hurt again.

19:34.640 --> 19:36.750
I'm trying to avoid that!

19:37.680 --> 19:41.230
I don't want anyone to look 
at me like that ever again.

19:45.050 --> 19:48.110
I'm not afraid of you.

19:56.760 --> 20:00.150
Also, that gryphon isn't coming after us.

20:00.150 --> 20:01.460
Is it giving us space?

20:04.210 --> 20:07.430
I think your magic is the reason.

20:07.430 --> 20:08.810
Anima?

20:08.810 --> 20:09.620
Yes.

20:09.620 --> 20:11.710
Wood doesn't conduct electricity.

20:11.710 --> 20:15.180
Plant magic might be 
the gryphons' weakness.

20:15.180 --> 20:16.950
I see!

20:16.950 --> 20:18.600
You really do know your stuff.

20:18.600 --> 20:20.900
I wonder if there's a good 
way to make use of that.

20:22.600 --> 20:24.670
There might be.

20:26.050 --> 20:27.440
Lend me your ear.

20:35.160 --> 20:37.240
All right, let's get started!

20:37.780 --> 20:40.470
First, get as close to it as you can.

20:40.750 --> 20:43.010
Over here, birdie!

20:43.010 --> 20:44.400
...and draw its attention.

20:45.140 --> 20:47.630
It'll use its lightning 
attack against you again.

20:47.630 --> 20:50.680
She made it sound easy, 
but this is really scary!

20:50.680 --> 20:53.310
Use your Anima to fend it off.

20:54.000 --> 20:55.190
Anima!

20:56.560 --> 21:01.110
While it's distracted, I'll throw my 
poison magic at it at close range!

21:01.110 --> 21:04.310
Red Stinger: Poison Injection!

21:06.740 --> 21:08.690
Yay!

21:08.690 --> 21:10.320
Our plan worked!

21:10.320 --> 21:13.210
Now we just need to run around until 
the poison starts taking effect.

21:14.200 --> 21:16.120
Thank you so much!

21:16.120 --> 21:17.960
You're amazing!

21:22.920 --> 21:24.380
D-Did it just smile?

21:24.380 --> 21:25.580
Why?!

21:25.980 --> 21:27.980
I'm too low on magic.

21:27.980 --> 21:30.930
I couldn't produce enough 
poison to take it down.

21:33.760 --> 21:36.760
Our plan failed.

21:41.630 --> 21:43.030
Are you okay?

21:44.240 --> 21:48.000
How could a gust of wind 
be so powerful? Man...

21:50.670 --> 21:53.170
Let's find a spot to hide.

23:25.800 --> 23:29.010
The exam's about to end, 
